  "claims": [
   "census: admissible residue words of length n number 3^(n+1)-2^(n+1); every word realised from a twin start >= 11 is admissible (converse not claimed; observed for n<=5)",
   "only mod 5 obstructs: mod 2 and mod 3 never form a complete residue system",
   "digit exclusivity (classical): a twin start a>5 ends in 1, 7 or 9",
   "junction (classical): p-2, p, p+2 all prime forces p = 5",
   "equilibrium obstruction: d_k = d_{k+1} impossible in cells 1->7, 7->1, 9->1, 9->7",
   "coprimality test confirms only below p^2 (first failure 49 at the 30-wheel)",
   "wheel: Z/2p = Z/2 x Z/p (layer, hue); units rotate hue; complement = half turn; twin pairs above 5 avoid the grey hue (necessary, not sufficient)",
   "colour at scale: at 10^k the primaries never split and other colours gain k, k, k^2 shades; zooming keeps the oriented coarse hue order; each zoom offers 4 then 5 refinements; the circle of 2 is coherent at every scale",
   "delays: twin delay h leaves free hues 3,1,2,2,1 (h mod 5); Hardy-Littlewood predicts these as weights, fit within 0.2 points over all pairs (measured); return delays have mean 4 but suppressed immediate return (measured)"
  ]
 },
